  'Literaturhaus Stuttgart names Tomer Gardi as this year’s Péter Horváth literary prize recipient. A presentation, reading and conversation about his novel Liefern are announced for November 3. The book examines delivery workers in the platform economy, with Klaus Kastberger moderating.',
